Package: pipeworks
Title: Visual Editor for 'targets' Pipelines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Heidler", , "git.tobias@heidler.ovh", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shows a 'targets' pipeline as a wiring diagram. Targets are grouped
    by their roxygen '@family' tag, and the roxygen documentation of each
    target's function is the primary source of information. Started from the
    R console with pipeworks(), so 'RStudio' stays the main editor.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    roxygen2,
    targets (>= 1.5.0),
    tools,
    utils,
    withr
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    readr,
    rmarkdown,
    rstudioapi,
    tarchetypes,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
